{"id":"vod_sn_36061","vodId":"36061","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"爱丽丝与藏六","name_cn":"爱丽丝与藏六","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9515edabe43fc4e89176d8ddbbaec5ee.jpg"},"summary":"纱名（大和田仁美 配音）自幼生活在“研究所”中，从未涉足过外面的世界。她拥有能够任意改变周遭物体的超级能力，因此被当做“危险品”一般受到重重监护。某日，再也忍无可忍的纱名逃出了研究所，随即遭到了组织的追捕。无处可去的纱名在走投无路的境遇下遇见了名为㭴村藏六（大冢明夫 配音）的老者，善良的老人收留了纱名。　　藏六和孙女早苗（丰崎爱生 配音）过着相依为命的生活，如今家中多了一个女孩，生活倏地热闹起来。和纱名一起逃出来的，还有个性大大咧咧自由奔放的雏雾朝日（藤原夏海 配音）和她的双胞胎妹妹雏雾夜长（鬼头明里 配音），女孩们所要面对的，是步步紧逼的研究员以及她们扑朔迷离的身世。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UBV0zjHQym1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3a2JU0MMja1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d6aN21Tuxg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rStCyDBdXn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BsKXLDvcD11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RkdCpMLfAH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UdZ8V58Siz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xqtWBfJtX91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u9HzT4T8w11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4X3LAPNddu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ey0KDHBdHe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cdz4L8AejW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f6Yn9LGFtF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:27.377Z"}